abstract: |
  GlycoAudit is an auditable benchmark-construction and evaluation framework for
  structure-supported glycan-binding relation recovery. It records identifier
  reconciliation, structural coverage, evidence status, provenance, candidate
  pools, and split definitions, and provides leakage-controlled evaluation for
  incomplete and heterogeneous binding evidence.
